<title>USA: East Pennsboro SD, Pa., won by William R Hough.</title>
<headline>East Pennsboro SD, Pa., won by William R Hough.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>William R. Hough &amp; Co said it won $9.290 million of East Pennsboro Area School District, Pa., general obligation bonds, Series A and AA of 1997 with a true interest cost of 4.85 percent without insurance recalculation.</p>
